  "_comment": "Each future's daily settlement window, in its exchange's own time zone (tz), as its exchange sets it: the watchlist's change is from the latest settlement until the next one. A future charted here gets its settlement worked out from its own stored trades in the window (the volume-weighted average, to the tick); one only quoted gets the one its exchange published, through NinjaTrader. A group's tz, window, calendar and early apply to each of its markets; a market can set its own. calendar: the CME holiday group in holidays.json (no settlement on a halt or closed day). early: the settlement time on an early-close day, by the holiday's name or 'default' ('normal': its usual window); never after the market's close that day (holidays.json). same_as: settles to that market's settlement (a micro to its E-mini), while both are on the same contract month. A settlement counts from the market's next open (CME's 17:00 CT Globex open; opens: its own daily open, weekdays), as TradingView keeps the day's change until then. From the exchanges' settlement procedures (CME Daily Settlement Time Details and its 2026 holiday notices, ICE, Eurex), Oct 2026. Not here: HKEX's HSI (the window isn't published) and OSE's Nikkei (the day session's last trade, 15:30-15:45 JST). Restart the server after editing.",
